From: Ronald Brown <rbrown4014@yahoo.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Jan 2023 19:08:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/34] fat32-boot: Attempt to fix umounting flash partition to
 prevent possible corruption on reboot

---
